  (lib_symbols)

  (text "═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                        AFE/ADC CORE - 2× RHD2164 (Rev 2.0)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ARCHITECTURE CHANGE (Rev 2.0):
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Rev 1.0: SPI bus → STM32G431 MCU → LVDS serializer → carrier
  Rev 2.0: SPI bus → B2B connector → carrier FPGA (direct passthrough)

  The carrier FPGA drives SCLK/MOSI/CS and captures MISO_A/MISO_B directly.
  No MCU, no serializer, no intermediate logic on headstage.

  CRITICAL: RHD2164 uses DDR SPI (dual MISO output).
    • MISO_A: channels 0–31 data (active on SCLK rising edge)
    • MISO_B: channels 32–63 data (active on SCLK rising edge)
    • Both MISO lines are active simultaneously during each SPI command

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

IC SELECTION: Intan RHD2164
  • 64 channels per IC (128 total with 2 ICs)
  • Integrated amplifiers + 16-bit ADC
  • 30 kS/s max per channel
  • Input-referred noise: 2.4 µVrms (typical, 300–6000 Hz BW)
  • DDR SPI interface (MISO_A + MISO_B / MOSI / SCLK / CS)
  • Supply: VDD = 3.3V (analog), VDDD = 3.3V (digital)
  • Digital I/O logic levels: 3.3V LVCMOS

SPI BUS ARCHITECTURE:
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

                  Carrier FPGA (via B2B connector J5)
                         │  │  │  │  │  │  │  │  │
                    SCLK ▼  ▼ MOSI  ▼CS1 ▼CS2  │  │  │  │
                    (in)   (in)   (in) (in)     │  │  │  │
  ┌──────────┐       │      │      │            │  │  │  │
  │ RHD2164  │       │      │      │            │  │  │  │
  │    U1    │◄──────┤◄─────┤◄─────┘            │  │  │  │
  │ CH1-64   │       │      │                   │  │  │  │
  │          │───MISO1_A──────────────────────►──┘  │  │  │
  │          │───MISO1_B──────────────────────────►─┘  │  │
  └──────────┘       │      │                          │  │
                     │      │                          │  │
  ┌──────────┐       │      │                          │  │
  │ RHD2164  │       │      │                          │  │
  │    U2    │◄──────┤◄─────┤◄── CS2                   │  │
  │ CH65-128 │       │      │                          │  │
  │          │───MISO2_A───────────────────────────────┘  │
  │          │───MISO2_B──────────────────────────────────┘
  └──────────┘

  Shared bus: SCLK, MOSI (directly from B2B to both U1/U2)
  Separate:   CS1 (U1 only), CS2 (U2 only)
  Separate:   MISO1_A, MISO1_B (from U1), MISO2_A, MISO2_B (from U2)

  TOTAL SIGNAL COUNT (headstage → carrier SPI):
    Carrier → Headstage: SCLK, MOSI, CS1, CS2 = 4 signals
    Headstage → Carrier: MISO1_A, MISO1_B, MISO2_A, MISO2_B = 4 signals
    Total SPI signals: 8

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

SERIES DAMPING RESISTORS (at driver side):
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Signal     Driver Side     Resistor    Value    Notes
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SCLK       Carrier FPGA    R_D1        33Ω      Place on CARRIER board
  MOSI       Carrier FPGA    R_D2        33Ω      Place on CARRIER board
  CS1        Carrier FPGA    R_D3        33Ω      Place on CARRIER board
  CS2        Carrier FPGA    R_D4        33Ω      Place on CARRIER board
  MISO1_A    RHD2164 U1      R_D5        33Ω      Place on HEADSTAGE
  MISO1_B    RHD2164 U1      R_D6        33Ω      Place on HEADSTAGE
  MISO2_A    RHD2164 U2      R_D7        33Ω      Place on HEADSTAGE
  MISO2_B    RHD2164 U2      R_D8        33Ω      Place on HEADSTAGE
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  All headstage-side damping resistors: 0402, DNI by default.
  Place footprints regardless. Populate if ringing observed.

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════="
